WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.386
The two Midpoint-Displacement variants differ only
in lambda.

00:00:04.466 --> 00:00:09.365
Tuned to mimic CCS, cosine similarity is about zero
point six three;

00:00:09.445 --> 00:00:13.392
tuned for accuracy, it drops to zero point three eight,

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:18.664
showing the displacement-versus-midpoint trade-off
defines CCS's target.

00:00:18.744 --> 00:00:23.130
Retuning lambda raises test accuracy to zero point
seven six.
